Ticket Confirmation

Hi <%= @ticket.buyer_name %>,

Thank you — your payment was successful! Here are your booking details:

Event:        <%= @event.title %>
Date:         <%= @event.starts_at.strftime("%A %d %B %Y") %>
<% if @event.doors_at.present? %>
Doors:        <%= @event.doors_at.strftime("%-l:%M%P") %>
<% end %>
Tickets:      <%= @ticket.quantity %>
Total paid:   €<%= number_with_precision(@ticket.amount_cents / 100.0, precision: 2) %>
<% if @event.venue_name.present? %>
Venue:        <%= @event.venue_name %><% if @event.venue_address.present? %>, <%= @event.venue_address %><% end %>
<% end %>

Please bring this email as proof of purchase.

View event details: <%= event_url(@event) %>

See you there!
THENCF
